26:["$","p","p-6",{"children":"Use a load generator to replay the actual read/edit/search mix, a metrics system to collect latency buckets and saturation, and a dashboard to compare the result with the target. These are complementary roles; a dashboard does not produce load and a load test does not replace production telemetry."}]
